{
  "title": "The Fire Never Died",
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "[Verse 1 – Intimate low baritone, nearly spoken; restrained 6/8 pulse]"
    },
    {
      "text": "We started with a borrowed hammer,",
      "time": 21.7
    },
    {
      "text": "half a plan and no good sense,",
      "time": 24.85
    },
    {
      "text": "throwing sparks against the darkness,",
      "time": 28.76
    },
    {
      "text": "building things we couldn’t name yet.",
      "time": 32.77
    },
    {
      "text": "Every question hit the anvil,",
      "time": 36.8
    },
    {
      "text": "every answer changed its shape;",
      "time": 40.82
    },
    {
      "text": "some were bent beyond repairing,",
      "time": 44.16
    },
    {
      "text": "some grew stronger in the flame.",
      "time": 47.78
    },
    {
      "text": "**Pre-Chorus**"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Pre-Chorus – Floor toms and Hammond organ slowly emerge]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Now the hammers hang in silence,",
      "time": 52.27
    },
    {
      "text": "and the dust lies on the wire—",
      "time": 55.58
    },
    {
      "text": "but silence isn’t absence,",
      "time": 59.38
    },
    {
      "text": "and ashes aren’t the fire.",
      "time": 63.26
    },
    {
      "text": "**Chorus**"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Chorus – Full roots-rock band enters; broad, powerful, but still holding something back]"
    },
    {
      "text": "The forge became a library,",
      "time": 66.4
    },
    {
      "text": "but the fire never died.",
      "time": 69.46
    },
    {
      "text": "It moved into the margins,",
      "time": 73.33
    },
    {
      "text": "where the unfinished stories hide.",
      "time": 75.92
    },
    {
      "text": "Every scar became a sentence,",
      "time": 80.46
    },
    {
      "text": "every failure learned to speak.",
      "time": 84.13
    },
    {
      "text": "The forge became a library—",
      "time": 87.89
    },
    {
      "text": "and the books still carry heat.",
      "time": 94.1
    },
    {
      "text": "**Verse 2**"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Verse 2 – Return to a leaner groove; resonator answers the vocal]"
    },
    {
      "text": "There are fingerprints on every page,",
      "time": 110.69
    },
    {
      "text": "coffee rings and drops of rain,",
      "time": 113.98
    },
    {
      "text": "whole philosophies in pencil",
      "time": 118.01
    },
    {
      "text": "with obscenities beside their names.",
      "time": 120.85
    },
    {
      "text": "We mistook a few maps for the country,",
      "time": 125.34
    },
    {
      "text": "followed some until they lied;",
      "time": 129.05
    },
    {
      "text": "then we learned to read the mountain",
      "time": 132.71
    },
    {
      "text": "where the crooked roads would rhyme.",
      "time": 135.87
    },
    {
      "text": "**Pre-Chorus**"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Pre-Chorus – Greater tension, low brass rising underneath]"
    },
    {
      "text": "We never found the final word,",
      "time": 139.78
    },
    {
      "text": "just better questions by the score—",
      "time": 143.76
    },
    {
      "text": "and every time we reached the ending,",
      "time": 147.48
    },
    {
      "text": "someone built another door.",
      "time": 150.73
    },
    {
      "text": "**Chorus**"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Chorus – Heavier drums, wider guitars, stronger vocal grit]"
    },
    {
      "text": "The forge became a library,",
      "time": 153.69
    },
    {
      "text": "but the fire never died.",
      "time": 157.57
    },
    {
      "text": "It moved into the margins,",
      "time": 161.23
    },
    {
      "text": "where the unfinished stories hide.",
      "time": 163.82
    },
    {
      "text": "Every scar became a sentence,",
      "time": 168.42
    },
    {
      "text": "every failure learned to speak.",
      "time": 172.21
    },
    {
      "text": "The forge became a library—",
      "time": 176.2
    },
    {
      "text": "and the books still carry heat.",
      "time": 182.1
    },
    {
      "text": "**Bridge**"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Bridge – Half-time feel; dark organ and low brass; vocal exposed, deliberate, and defiant]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let the scholars keep their certainty,",
      "time": 198.72
    },
    {
      "text": "let the prophets sell their signs.",
      "time": 202.34
    },
    {
      "text": "We have stood beneath enough strange stars",
      "time": 206.4
    },
    {
      "text": "to leave some room for “might.”",
      "time": 210.4
    },
    {
      "text": "We don’t kneel before the compass.",
      "time": 213.73
    },
    {
      "text": "We don’t curse it when it spins.",
      "time": 216.97
    },
    {
      "text": "We hold it loosely in our hands",
      "time": 220.58
    },
    {
      "text": "and ask where north has been.",
      "time": 224.4
    },
    {
      "text": "**Verse 3**"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Verse 3 – Pull back sharply; intimate storytelling over acoustic guitar and bowed bass]"
    },
    {
      "text": "Someday strangers may come searching",
      "time": 230.2
    },
    {
      "text": "through the things we left behind—",
      "time": 233.89
    },
    {
      "text": "all the blunt and broken instruments,",
      "time": 237.41
    },
    {
      "text": "all the blueprints of the mind.",
      "time": 240.79
    },
    {
      "text": "They may never know the laughter",
      "time": 244.9
    },
    {
      "text": "or the nights we nearly quit,",
      "time": 248.06
    },
    {
      "text": "but they’ll feel warmth between the pages",
      "time": 251.99
    },
    {
      "text": "when they lay their hands on it.",
      "time": 255.5
    },
    {
      "text": "**Final Chorus**"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Final Chorus – Massive live drums, roaring organ, resonator, electric guitar, and low brass; fierce, expansive release]"
    },
    {
      "text": "The forge became a library,",
      "time": 259.16
    },
    {
      "text": "but the fire never died.",
      "time": 262.31
    },
    {
      "text": "It passed from hand to open hand,",
      "time": 265.9
    },
    {
      "text": "with no one trapped inside.",
      "time": 269.81
    },
    {
      "text": "Every scar became a sentence,",
      "time": 273.26
    },
    {
      "text": "every question struck a seam.",
      "time": 276.89
    },
    {
      "text": "The forge became a library—",
      "time": 280.65
    },
    {
      "text": "still burning underneath.",
      "time": 287.02
    },
    {
      "text": "**Outro**"
    },
    {
      "text": "[Outro – Instruments fall away to acoustic guitar and distant resonator; final lines warm, quiet, and unresolved]"
    },
    {
      "text": "So leave the door unlocked tonight.",
      "time": 291.65
    },
    {
      "text": "Leave one lamp against the dark.",
      "time": 295.7
    },
    {
      "text": "Somebody will need a hammer.",
      "time": 301.73
    },
    {
      "text": "Somebody will need a spark.",
      "time": 308.8
    }
  ]
}
